<li>S1 Program studi Manajemen, Universitas Diponegoro (1995-2001)</li>
<li>S1 Program studi Teknik Informatika, STMIK Stikubank (1996-2000)</li>
<li>S2 Internet and E-Commerce Technology, Assumption University, Thailand (2005-2006)</li>
<li>S3 Computer Information System, Assumption University, Thailand (2008-2011)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Riwayat Pekerjaan di Universitas Katolik Soegijapranata</h2>
<ul>
<li>Dosen: sejak 1 Oktober 2002</li>
<li>Asisten Ahli: 1 April 2004</li>
